    "title": "Best EV Charging Apps for Asia: Which Ones Actually Work [2026]",
    "excerpt": "Honest comparison of the best EV charging apps in Southeast and East Asia for 2026. From PlugShare to Gentari Go, JomCharge to ACMobility Evro — coverage, prices, reliability, and which to install before your road trip.",
    "date": "2026-05-12",
